# CDK's DockerImageCode.fromImageAsset bundles the *entire* directory passed to it (the
# repo root, since the Lambda builder stage needs include/ and src/ from the main engine
# tree) as the Docker build context, AND fingerprints that same post-.dockerignore tree
# to decide whether the image needs rebuilding -- not just what the Dockerfile actually
# COPYs. Two real problems found this way, both fixed here:
#
# 1. Without exclusions, the context included build/ (CMake artifacts, including a full
#    nested git checkout under _deps/), infra/cdk.out/ itself (recursively, compounding
#    on every synth), and every node_modules/. cdk synth failed with ENAMETOOLONG from
#    infra/cdk.out/ copying itself into itself repeatedly (grew to 2.3GB before failing).
# 2. Even after fixing (1), any edit to a file *anywhere* in the repo -- README.md, a
#    doc, infra/lib/*.ts -- changed the asset fingerprint and forced a spurious image
#    rebuild/republish on the next `cdk deploy`, even though the actual image bytes were
#    identical (Docker's own layer cache hit every step; only CDK's directory-hash
#    changed). Fixed by inverting to an allowlist: ignore everything, then explicitly
#    un-ignore exactly the paths infra/lambda/Dockerfile's builder stage COPYs -- plus
#    the Dockerfile itself (a third real bug this allowlist first tripped over: CDK
#    stages a *filtered copy* of the context to cdk.out/ before invoking `docker build
#    --file infra/lambda/Dockerfile`, unlike a plain local `docker buildx build -f ...`,
#    which reads the Dockerfile straight off disk -- so if the Dockerfile isn't in the
#    allowlist, the staged copy doesn't have it, and the build fails with "Dockerfile:
#    no such file or directory" even though the exact same command works when run
#    directly against the real repo tree).
*

!infra/lambda/Dockerfile
!include/
!include/**
!src/core/types.cpp
!src/core/normal.cpp
!src/core/rng.cpp
!src/core/thread_pool.cpp
!src/core/linalg.cpp
!src/core/sobol.cpp
!src/models/
!src/models/**
!src/pricers/
!src/pricers/**
!src/greeks/
!src/greeks/**
!bindings/python/src/module.cpp
!setup.py
!pyproject.toml
!infra/lambda/handler.py
!infra/lambda/request.py
!infra/lambda/cfa_invariants.py
